Where to find each NOTICE
- AndroidLuna/src/main/assets/ (fonts, images, sounds, ringtones, wallpapers, system UI,
  certificates, services), CoreApps/<app id>/, LunaKeyboard/ and its assets/, and Meta/.
- The frameworks and native runtimes are fetched or built at build time
  (AndroidLuna/fetch-assets.sh, AndroidLuna/tools/build-pdk.sh, build-busybox.sh), which
  write their NOTICEs into the APK's assets beside them: the frameworks (fw/enyo, fw/mojo,
  fw/frameworks), the PDK runtime (pdk/NOTICE, pdk/LICENSE.openssl) and the webOS root
  filesystem (rootfs/NOTICE.*).
